- SLT-LIFE-05 and SLT-LIFE-03 complete; S5 `arraysubs-active`, `_recurring_amount=20`, no pending skip or open renewal order.
- D8 (2026-08-10) is the only authorised date-meta time-travel day (audit C07/C17).
